        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yosuwa igihe yar’ amaze gusēzera abantu, umuntu wese aja mw ishamvu yiwe, ngo begukire ico gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa akiriho, abantu bāgumye k’Uhoraho, no mu gihe cose c’abakuru bāsigaye Yosuwa amaze gupfa, abāri bārabonye ibikorwa vyose bihambaye Uhoraho yakoreye Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa mwene Nuni umusavyi w’Uhoraho ahwera amaze imyaka ijana n’icumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bāmuhamvye mw ishamvu yiwe bgite i Timunati‐sera mu mugamba w’Abefurayimu, ku ruhande rw’i burārūko rw’ umusozi Gashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma ab’ urwo runganwe bose na bo barapfa, bahamvya ababo; bakurikirwa n’urundi runganwe, abo bo bakura batazi Uhoraho, canke ngo bamenye igikorwa yakoreye Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
