        {
          "text": "Ariko bakanka kwumvira abo bacamanza babo, bakagenda bahurumbira izindi mana nk’ibimaka, bakazūnamira, bagata vuba inzira ba sekuruza bāhora bagenderamwo, ntibumvira ivyagezwe vy’ Uhoraho nk’ukw abo bāvyumvira. ",
