        {
          "text": "Kand’ uk’ Uhoraho yabaha umucamanza, yaba kumwe n’uwo mucamanza, akabakiza, akabakūra mu maboko y’abansi babo igihe cose uwo mucamanza akiriho, kuko vyamutera akagongwe kwumva iminiho yabo banihishwa n’ababahahaza bakabacuranguza. ",
